	(text "Servo rail 6.8 V (candidate, O-19) from VBAT_PROT, 3S. LTC7803 at 375 kHz, forced continuous, 100 % duty; RSENSE 3 mOhm, L 3.3 uH candidate. Feedback tapped at the output capacitors before RS402."
